    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your lightning reflexes allow you to complete complex actions in response to the actions of others.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, you can use two different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a> in response to the same trigger. For example, if you use the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deflect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deflect\">Deflect</a></b> Talent and fail to negate the attack, you can also use <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Negate_Energy\" title=\"Negate Energy\">Negate Energy</a></i> as a response to the same attack.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> Without this Feat, you can use only one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> in response to a particular trigger.</p>",
